  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">International Planned Parenthood Federation (IPPF) Core Funding 2022-23 to-2026-2027</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Australia&apos;s contribution to the International Planned Parenthood Federation (IPPF) provides core funding to support sexual and reproductive health and rights services and information, access to safe and effective contraception, maternal health and programs to combat gender based violence. This initiative supports IPPF&apos;s Global Strategy 2023-2028 and Nui Vaka II Pacific Strategy 2023-2028. It includes $5.7 million (approx $1.5 million per year) specifically to support IPPF&apos;s Pacific operations.</narrative>
  </description>
