    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Health</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Australian Government provides global core funding to the International Planned Parenthood Federation, the world&apos;s largest NGO working to advance universal, comprehensive sexual and reproductive health and rights. In 2024, with Australian core funding, IPPF reached 775,675 people and delivered contraceptive commodities that provided 216,064 couple years of protection from unintended pregnancies.</narrative>
    </description>
